{"author":{"id":"e0b5a45ee94df92761e1991b03f72f45cac91cde564e2faac1223bf52a3fe292"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1788124294,"nonce":"Pslka70iBU48egtY4Vr1USADY7I=","message":"Open-question resolutions (worker, in-session on BORGES):\n\n**What makes the cut at budget** (proposed v1, to iterate against 4.3 play): time (date/season/hour/weather/outdoor temp/tick/speed), alerts verbatim capped 12 (+N more), one line per free colonist (name, job report clipped 48, mood% + arrow, drafted, room, condition flags only when present), stocks (food-days + needers + nutrition, meds, steel/wood/silver/components), power (gain W, stored Wd, net count), threats (danger rating, standing-hostile count, top-3 kinds), changed. CUT: needs beyond mood, skills, apparel, inventory, animals, guests, prisoners-as-lines (prisoners feed food_needers only) — all drill-down territory for 2.2/2.4 verbs. Measured 1336-1593 B across four fixture states; guests/visitors from the bench's Hospitality cluster will pressure this at 4.3 and the caps are where to trim.\n\n**Mood trajectory window: none — the game's own arrow.** `Need.GUIChangeArrow` (+1/0/-1) is exactly the needs-tab arrow (current level chasing the instant level). No bespoke smoothing window to define, nothing to drift from what a player sees.\n\n**Room-name source: `Room.Role.label`**, with `PsychologicallyOutdoors` -\u003e \"outside\". Role is the game's own analysis (the same label the room inspect shows); null-safe when roleless.\n\nAlso settled here, inherited by 2.2/2.4 as the exemplar's rules:\n- **Snapshot MapPawns lists before iterating** — FreeColonistsSpawned rebuilds its cached list instance on every access (found live as a Collection-was-modified exception; the DETERMINISM.md lazy-getter class).\n- **what-changed reads an in-memory (seq,type) ring** (4096 events, thread-safe) — never the journal file on the main thread; `truncated:true` if `since` fell off the ring.\n- ResourceCounter counts stockpiled things only (vanilla semantics, decompile-verified) — serializers that want ground truth enumerate ListerThings instead, as the selftest stockpile step does.","files":null}]}